&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3e Ant. Ps.88&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;div class="vsa-container"&gt;&lt;img class="vsa-notation" src="https://orthodox-groningen.github.io/VSA-demo/vsa/praktijk-feesteigen-08-aug-08-06-verheerlijking-op-de-berg-thabor-block-3.svg" alt="VSA notatie" loading="lazy"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
